  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_HEADER.webp\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=9033af&amp;label=DCORD&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-9033af?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 項目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-9033af?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 項目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fend-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"檢視結構\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER1.webp\" alt=\"概覽\"></p><p>此模組支援 Forge、Fabric、NeoForge 與 Quilt！也可僅安裝於伺服器端。1.20.4 版本後停止支援 Forge。</p><h3>關於</h3><p>Moog's End Structures 為終界維度注入新生命，引入了一系列完美融入原有地形的全新結構。每個結構皆使用原版方塊與實體精心打造，保留經典的 Minecraft 風格。當您探索終界時，將遭遇獨特的挑戰、強悍的敵人以及珍貴的戰利品。此模組可與任何模組包相容，並可與 Moog's Voyager Structures (MVS) 一同安裝，以獲得更豐富的遊戲體驗。立即深入終界，探索 Moog's End Structures 中隱藏的寶藏！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fend-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"以 3D 方式瀏覽每個結構\"></a></p><p>我們的主要結構模組 MVS 請見<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-voyager-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fmes-moogs-end-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ApCtgr7.png\" alt=\"MinecraftStorage\"></a></p><div><h3><strong>Biomes O Plenty</strong> 相容性資料包</h3><br><div>我為 Moog's End Structures 建立了一個專屬的相容性資料包，以增強其與熱門模組 <strong>Biomes O Plenty</strong> 的整合。這個資料包會將我們部分既有結構的風格切換為使用 BOP 的方塊，讓同時安裝兩個模組時能帶來更一致且沉浸的體驗。您可以在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/mes-biomes-o-plenty-compat-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>尋找並下載此相容性資料包。</div></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>配置包</h3><p>模組的每個面向都可透過資料包自訂。內含完整說明的範本可於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mes-moogs-end-structures-config-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>找到。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER2.webp\" alt=\"特色\"> <img src=\"https://imgur.com/YPIvnN1.png\" alt=\"拼貼圖\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER2.webp\" alt=\"展示\"></p><h3>影片</h3><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gqCYji1o2Xs?wmode=transparent&amp;start=102\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1XGKnGel1oI?wmode=transparent&amp;start=239\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/khBGeEdrWuc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3>模組包</h3><p>查看所有模組包請見<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252ffinder%253fincluded_mods%253d46028\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER3.webp\" alt=\"DCORD\"></p><p>獲得回覆最快的方式是加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_PROMO.webp\" alt=\"BH贊助\"></a></p>",
